/pulls/124059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124059","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124059.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124059.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-05T15:59:31Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Related to #122811 (does not address the main issue of completion not appearing after func in the editor; only fixes the test failures also reported in the issue)\r\n- Completion tests read the developer's personal editor settings file, so they can fail depending on those settings.\r\n- The 2 test failures reported in the issue can be reproduced by disabling `add_type_hints` in the editor settings and running the tests.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n- `indent/size` also caused test failures when changed from the default in the developer's settings, so I pinned it as well.\r\n- Other unpinned settings that completion code reads (`indent/type`, `complete_file_paths`) don't currently affect the test results, so I left them out of this PR.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":